---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="ja">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
		<title>404 | World Foundation Design</title>
		<style>
			:root {
				color-scheme: light dark;
				font-family:
					-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial,
					sans-serif;
				background: #101318;
				color: #f4f6f8;
			}

			body {
				min-height: 100vh;
				margin: 0;
				display: grid;
				place-items: center;
				padding: 24px;
			}

			main {
				width: min(100%, 680px);
			}

			p {
				color: #b8c0cc;
				line-height: 1.8;
			}

			a {
				color: #8ab4ff;
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<main>
			<h1>404</h1>
			<p>ページが見つかりません。サイドバーまたは検索から目的の文書を探してください。</p>
			<p><a href={base}>World Foundation Design に戻る</a></p>
		</main>
	</body>
</html>
